{"id":"d8ba1827c96f11ce","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-filter-prime.md","title":"Prime Filter","display":"Prime Filter","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-filter-prime","aliases":["93-fact-filter-prime"],"display":"Prime Filter","depends_on":["[[93-df-boolalg]]","[[93-df-prime-filter]]","[[93-df-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-filter-prime"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-filter-prime</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Prime Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a830918010f1575a\" href=\"?note=a830918010f1575a\" title=\"93-df-prime-filter\">93-df-prime-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc989d8f8938c283\" href=\"?note=fc989d8f8938c283\" title=\"93-df-ultrafilter\">93-df-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is a Boolean-algebra candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A^{01}\">\\(\\mathbf A^{01}\\)</span> is the bounded distributive reduct of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a830918010f1575a\" href=\"?note=a830918010f1575a\" title=\"93-df-prime-filter\">93-df-prime-filter</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc989d8f8938c283\" href=\"?note=fc989d8f8938c283\" title=\"93-df-ultrafilter\">93-df-ultrafilter</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}filter\\text{-}prime}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf A^{01})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf A)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}filter\\text{-}prime}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf A^{01})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf A)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>In a Boolean algebra a proper prime filter of the sourced bounded-lattice reduct is equivalently an ultrafilter of the Boolean algebra. No free carrier or operation tuple remains.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolalg]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-prime-filter","status":"resolved","id":"a830918010f1575a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-prime-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"fc989d8f8938c283","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf A$ is a Boolean-algebra candidate and $\\mathbf A^{01}$ is the bounded distributive reduct of [[93-df-boolalg]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-prime-filter","status":"resolved","id":"a830918010f1575a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-prime-filter]] and [[93-df-ultrafilter]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"fc989d8f8938c283","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-prime-filter]] and [[93-df-ultrafilter]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A^{01}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}filter\\text{-}prime}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PrimeFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf A^{01})\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(F,\\mathbf A)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":981,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["757a95a2c335d9fb","a830918010f1575a","fc989d8f8938c283"]}